<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Unibank says first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Unibank says first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			11.06	  vs    9.97</p>
<p>    Net interest income	   31.43	  vs    29.31</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rph)    86	    vs     -</p>
<p>    Other operating income	10.71	  vs    7.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  15.97	  vs   14.09</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     22.97	  vs   24.73</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were consolidated. PT Unibank is a medium-sized privately-owned bank.</p>
